<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>

<LanguageData>
<!--=============== Quest - Hunted Agent ====================-->
<!--=============== NameRules ====================-->
<OE_Quest_HuntedAgent.questNameRules.rulesStrings>
  <li>questName->拯救[askerIndef]</li>
  <li>questName->帮助[askerIndef]</li>
  <li>questName->[askerAdj][askerIndef]</li>
  <li>questName->[enemyFaction_pawnsPlural]追捕[askerIndef]</li>
  <li>questName->[enemyFaction_pawnsPlural]狩猎[askerIndef]</li>
  <li>questName->战火之中</li>
  <li>questName->最后的抵抗</li>
  <!-- Pieces -->
  <li>askerAdj->绝望的</li>
  <li>askerAdj->疯狂的</li>
  <li>askerAdj->被猎杀的</li>
  <li>askerIndef->特工</li>
  <li>askerIndef->[asker_nameFull]</li>
  <li>askerIndef->[asker_royalTitleInCurrentFaction]</li>
</OE_Quest_HuntedAgent.questNameRules.rulesStrings>

<!--=============== DescriptionRules ====================-->
<OE_Quest_HuntedAgent.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>
  <li>questDescription->[asker_nameFull]，[asker_faction_name]的一名经验丰富的[asker_royalTitleInCurrentFaction]，刚刚勉强逃脱了一次致命的伏击。随着[asker_possessive]敌人紧追不舍，[asker_pronoun]急需支援。在援军到达之前，保护[asker_objective]在[map_definite]的安全，[asker_pronoun]承诺给予[royalFavorReward][asker_faction_royalFavorLabel]作为回报。\n敌方[enemyFaction_pawnsPlural]小组由以下成员组成：\n[raid/raidPawnKinds]\n\n[asker_nameDef]正忙于躲避子弹，无法提供更多细节。</li>
  <li>questDescription->[asker_nameFull]，[asker_faction_name]中最狡猾的[asker_royalTitleInCurrentFaction]之一，勉强从一场失败的伏击中逃脱。现在，[asker_possessive]敌人正在快速逼近，[asker_pronoun]需要帮助以在援军到来前活下来。在[map_definite]与[asker_nameDef]会面，保护[asker_pronoun]的安全，你将获得[royalFavorReward][asker_faction_royalFavorLabel]作为奖励。\n敌方[enemyFaction_pawnsPlural]小组由以下成员组成：\n[raid/raidPawnKinds]\n\n[asker_nameDef]过于震惊，无法提供更多细节。</li>
  <li>questDescription->[asker_nameFull]，[asker_faction_name]的关键人物，走入了一个陷阱。随着[asker_possessive]护卫死亡，[asker_pronoun]正在逃亡，时间紧迫。[asker_pronoun]需要在[map_definite]获得支援，以抵御敌人直到风头过去。[asker_pronoun]承诺以[royalFavorReward][asker_faction_royalFavorLabel]作为交换。\n敌方[enemyFaction_pawnsPlural]小组由以下成员组成：\n[raid/raidPawnKinds]\n\n[asker_nameDef]过于激动，无法解释更多。</li>
</OE_Quest_HuntedAgent.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>

<!--=============== Roots ====================-->
<!--=============== Raid arrives ====================-->
<OE_Quest_HuntedAgent.root.nodes.Delay.node.nodes.Util_Raid.parms.customLetterLabel.value.slateRef>{BASELABEL}正在追捕[../asker_nameDef]</OE_Quest_HuntedAgent.root.nodes.Delay.node.nodes.Util_Raid.parms.customLetterLabel.value.slateRef>
<OE_Quest_HuntedAgent.root.nodes.Delay.node.nodes.Util_Raid.parms.customLetterText.value.slateRef>{BASETEXT}\n\n[enemyFaction_pawnsPlural]前来抓捕[../asker_nameDef]。</OE_Quest_HuntedAgent.root.nodes.Delay.node.nodes.Util_Raid.parms.customLetterText.value.slateRef>
<!--=============== Shuttle ====================-->
<OE_Quest_HuntedAgent.root.nodes.ShuttleDelay.node.nodes.InspectString.inspectString.slateRef>应乘坐穿梭机离开</OE_Quest_HuntedAgent.root.nodes.ShuttleDelay.node.nodes.InspectString.inspectString.slateRef>
<OE_Quest_HuntedAgent.root.nodes.ShuttleDelay.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>穿梭机已到达</OE_Quest_HuntedAgent.root.nodes.ShuttleDelay.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>
<OE_Quest_HuntedAgent.root.nodes.ShuttleDelay.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>穿梭机已到达接[asker_nameDef]。</OE_Quest_HuntedAgent.root.nodes.ShuttleDelay.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>
<!--=============== Asker died ====================-->
<OE_Quest_HuntedAgent.root.nodes.askerDestroyed.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>访客死亡：{SUBJECT_definite}</OE_Quest_HuntedAgent.root.nodes.askerDestroyed.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>
<OE_Quest_HuntedAgent.root.nodes.askerDestroyed.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>你被委托保护的{SUBJECT_definite}已经死亡。[failLetterEndingCommon]</OE_Quest_HuntedAgent.root.nodes.askerDestroyed.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>
<!--=============== Surgery Violation ====================-->
<OE_Quest_HuntedAgent.root.nodes.askerSurgeryViolation.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>未经授权的手术：{SUBJECT_definite}</OE_Quest_HuntedAgent.root.nodes.askerSurgeryViolation.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>
<OE_Quest_HuntedAgent.root.nodes.askerSurgeryViolation.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>对被你委托保护的{SUBJECT_definite}进行了未经授权、违反规定的手术。由于此违规行为，[asker_pronoun]现在将尝试离开。[failLetterEndingCommon]</OE_Quest_HuntedAgent.root.nodes.askerSurgeryViolation.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>
<!--=============== Lodger's xenogerm absorbed ====================-->
<OE_Quest_HuntedAgent.root.nodes.askerXenogermAbsorbed.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>异种胚芽被吸收：{SUBJECT_definite}</OE_Quest_HuntedAgent.root.nodes.askerXenogermAbsorbed.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>
<OE_Quest_HuntedAgent.root.nodes.askerXenogermAbsorbed.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>你被委托保护的{SUBJECT_definite}的异种胚芽被强行吸收了。由于此违规行为，{SUBJECT_pronoun}现在将尝试离开。[failLetterEndingCommon]</OE_Quest_HuntedAgent.root.nodes.askerXenogermAbsorbed.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>
<!--=============== Lodger arrested ====================-->
<OE_Quest_HuntedAgent.root.nodes.askerArrested.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>被俘虏：{SUBJECT_definite}</OE_Quest_HuntedAgent.root.nodes.askerArrested.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>
<OE_Quest_HuntedAgent.root.nodes.askerArrested.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>你被委托接待的{SUBJECT_definite}已被逮捕。[failLetterEndingCommon]</OE_Quest_HuntedAgent.root.nodes.askerArrested.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>
<!--=============== Asker left map ====================-->
<OE_Quest_HuntedAgent.root.nodes.askerLeftMap.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>访客丢失：{SUBJECT_definite}</OE_Quest_HuntedAgent.root.nodes.askerLeftMap.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>
<OE_Quest_HuntedAgent.root.nodes.askerLeftMap.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>你被委托保护的{SUBJECT_definite}已离开指定定居点。[failLetterEndingCommon]</OE_Quest_HuntedAgent.root.nodes.askerLeftMap.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>
<!--=============== Lodger ran wild ====================-->
<OE_Quest_HuntedAgent.root.nodes.askerRanWild.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>访客丢失：{SUBJECT_definite}</OE_Quest_HuntedAgent.root.nodes.askerRanWild.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>
<OE_Quest_HuntedAgent.root.nodes.askerRanWild.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>你被委托保护的{SUBJECT_definite}已失控。[failLetterEndingCommon]</OE_Quest_HuntedAgent.root.nodes.askerRanWild.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>
<!--=============== Shuttle destroyed ====================-->
<OE_Quest_HuntedAgent.root.nodes.pickupShipThingDestroyed.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>穿梭机被摧毁</OE_Quest_HuntedAgent.root.nodes.pickupShipThingDestroyed.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef> 
<OE_Quest_HuntedAgent.root.nodes.pickupShipThingDestroyed.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>派来接[asker_nameDef]的穿梭机已被摧毁。[asker_pronoun]现在将步行离开。[failLetterEndingCommon]</OE_Quest_HuntedAgent.root.nodes.pickupShipThingDestroyed.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>
<!--=============== Shuttle sent ====================-->
<OE_Quest_HuntedAgent.root.nodes.pickupShipThingSentUnsatisfied.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>任务失败：[resolvedQuestName]</OE_Quest_HuntedAgent.root.nodes.pickupShipThingSentUnsatisfied.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>
<OE_Quest_HuntedAgent.root.nodes.pickupShipThingSentUnsatisfied.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>派来接[asker_nameDef]的穿梭机在没有[asker_objective]的情况下离开了。[asker_pronoun]现在将步行离开。[failLetterEndingCommon]</OE_Quest_HuntedAgent.root.nodes.pickupShipThingSentUnsatisfied.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>

</LanguageData>